{"4314430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Chronicles: Immortal Sect", "steam_appid": 4314430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Shaped by Your Will</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices trigger butterfly effects in the strife-ridden Three Thousand Realms. Pursue peace or ignite a war spanning the three factions—humans, immortals, and demons. True cultivation is not just about personal ascension, but also about steering the world's destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314430/extras/3af5d3f92441129061d69ce3bfcebf11.poster.avif?t=1779939267\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314430/extras/3af5d3f92441129061d69ce3bfcebf11.webm?t=1779939267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314430/extras/3af5d3f92441129061d69ce3bfcebf11.mp4?t=1779939267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complex Sects &amp; Unique Arts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a landscape of powerful factions, each with its own philosophy, storylines, and skill trees. Align with sects like the swift sword-focused Taixu or the balanced Qitian. Your path—righteous, ambitious, or demonic—shapes your alliances and rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314430/extras/71d10fe87e1724500cc1f788395cbe69.poster.avif?t=1779939267\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314430/extras/71d10fe87e1724500cc1f788395cbe69.webm?t=1779939267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314430/extras/71d10fe87e1724500cc1f788395cbe69.mp4?t=1779939267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dao Companionship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a deep relationship system. Meet diverse female cultivators, build connections through unique quests, and develop bonds that can lead to marriage and beyond. These companions offer not just emotional ties but also tangible support on your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Path of Ascension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the classic cultivation stages, from Qi Refining to Foundation Building, Golden Core, Nascent Soul, and more. Each major breakthrough brings significant power boosts and new abilities, providing a clear and rewarding growth path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314430/extras/340746eb84ea67fcb9a54f65f93d2a3e.poster.avif?t=1779939267\" width=618 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314430/extras/340746eb84ea67fcb9a54f65f93d2a3e.webm?t=1779939267\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4314430/extras/340746eb84ea67fcb9a54f65f93d2a3e.mp4?t=1779939267\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Astral Destiny System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock permanent enhancements by activating celestial bodies on the unique Astral Destiny chart. This system allows you to tailor your cultivator's abilities, creating a truly personalized build that complements your playstyle</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A World Shaped by Your Will</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cho